* -dialect=c32: add/sub/and/or/cmp #imm,Dn in C 3.2's <ea>,Dn form.
* fixed: 194231a 2026-10-09 r68togas: first fixes from comparisons with Microware's r68; m68k-os9-r68 -dialect=c32
* fixed: db2dd88 2026-10-09 r68togas: ! < > escaped in <...> macro arguments; c32 immediates in parentheses
* options: -dialect=c32
